REASON
NEW FILES. Runnable example built on examples/shared/example.css: a hero that opens
with a dropped message plus the four typed shorthands, a playground over every
config property (with equivalent code and an onShow/onClose reason log), effect
cards per alignment, a sticky message closed through its handle, element content
with an Undo button, and the validation errors. The narrow-screen grid uses
minmax(0,1fr), because a plain 1fr let the code snippet's long line widen the page
to 752px on a 390px phone.

